isource.org/wiki/資治通鑑/卷018","reference_event_quote":"鴈門馬邑豪聶壹，因大行王恢言","reference_year_quote":"元光二年（戊申，公元前一三三年）"},"record_id":"th-shiji110-074","person_id":"jwl_kis_jqj","attestation_id":"th-shiji110-074:a001","date_role":"attestation","title":"將軍"}],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[{"id":"eq-shiji110-jwl_kis_jqj","person_ids":["jwl_kis_jqj","z2v_oh4_mhm"],"canonical_person_id":"z2v_oh4_mhm","status":"contextual_provisional","scope":"cross_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-110-xiongnu","c-shiji-108-han"],"rationale":"按文景交替後今帝為武帝，或馬邑誘敵、同一護軍及尉史受天王號的具名事件對讀。軍臣承第28段敘事至馬邑單于；保留兩篇兵數、護軍稱與王恢斬／自殺的差異，不以同指抹平事件異說。","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu","source_id":"s-shiji110-xiongnu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:p030","quote":"漢使馬邑下人聶翁壹奸蘭出物與匈奴交，詳爲賣馬邑城以誘單于。單于信之，而貪馬邑財物，乃以十萬騎入武州塞。漢伏兵三十餘萬馬邑旁，御史大夫韓安國爲護軍，護四將軍以伏單于。單于既入漢塞，未至馬邑百餘里，見畜布野而無人牧者，怪之，乃攻亭。是時鴈門尉史行徼，見寇，葆此亭，知漢兵謀，單于得，欲殺之，尉史乃告單于漢兵所居。單于大驚曰：「吾固疑之。」乃引兵還。出曰：「吾得尉史，天也，天使若言。」以尉史爲「天王」。漢兵約單于入馬邑而縱，單于不至，以故漢兵無所得。漢將軍王恢部出代擊胡輜重，聞單于還，兵多，不敢出。漢以恢本造兵謀而不進，斬恢。自是之後，匈奴絕和親，攻當路塞，往往入盜於漢邊，不可勝數。然匈奴貪，尚樂關市，嗜漢財物，漢亦尚關市不絕以中之。","mention_ids":["c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m030-0226","c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m030-0250","c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m030-0260"]},{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-108-han","source_id":"s-shiji-108-han","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-108-han:p009","quote":"當是時，漢伏兵車騎材官二十餘萬，匿馬邑旁谷中。衞尉李廣爲驍騎將軍，太仆公孫賀爲輕車將軍，大行王恢爲將屯將軍，太中大夫李息爲材官將軍。御史大夫韓安國爲護軍將軍，諸將皆屬護軍。約單于入馬邑而漢兵縱發。王恢、李息、李廣別從代主擊其輜重。於是單于入漢長城武州塞。未至馬邑百餘里，行掠鹵，徒見畜牧於野，不見一人。單于怪之，攻烽燧，得武州尉史。欲刺問尉史。尉史曰：「漢兵數十萬伏馬邑下。」單于顧謂左右曰：「幾爲漢所賣！」乃引兵還。出塞，曰：「吾得尉史，乃天也。」命尉史爲「天王」。塞下傳言單于已引去。漢兵追至塞，度弗及，即罷。王恢等兵三萬，聞單于不與漢合，度往擊輜重，必與單于精兵戰，漢兵勢必敗，則以便宜罷兵，皆無功。","mention_ids":["c-shiji-108-han:m009-0046","c-shiji-108-han:m009-0098","c-shiji-108-han:m009-0257"]}],"reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:p006","text":"建元中，武安侯田蚡爲漢太尉，親貴用事，安國以五百金物遺蚡。蚡言安國太后，天子亦素聞其賢，即召以爲北地都尉，遷爲大司農。閩越、東越相攻，安國及大行王恢將。未至越，越殺其王降，漢兵亦罷。建元六年，武安侯爲丞相，安國爲御史大夫。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m006-0004","start":4,"end":7,"surface":"武安侯","kind":"person","person_id":"l3m_tk9_u47","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m006-0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"田蚡","kind":"person","person_id":"l3m_tk9_u47","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m006-0019","start":19,"end":21,"surface":"安國","kind":"person","person_id":"adb_4so_0qm","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m006-0027","start":27,"end":28,"surface":"蚡","kind":"person","person_id":"l3m_tk9_u47","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m006-0029","start":29,"end":30,"surface":"蚡","kind":"person","person_id":"l3m_tk9_u47","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m006-0031","start":31,"end":33,"surface":"安國","kind":"person","person_id":"adb_4so_0qm","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m006-0033","start":33,"end":35,"surface":"太后","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未明示姓氏；田蚡之外家支持王太后，建元中仍可能涉及竇太后，暫留候選。"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m006-0036","start":36,"end":38,"surface":"天子","kind":"person","person_id":"zgv_3zp_3tg","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m006-0067","start":67,"end":69,"surface":"安國","kind":"person","person_id":"adb_4so_0qm","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m006-0072","start":72,"end":74,"surface":"王恢","kind":"person","person_id":"z2v_oh4_mhm","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m006-0083","start":83,"end":84,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"px6_0om_awh","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m006-0096","start":96,"end":99,"surface":"武安侯","kind":"person","person_id":"l3m_tk9_u47","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m006-0103","start":103,"end":105,"surface":"安國","kind":"person","person_id":"adb_4so_0qm","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-108-han","book_id":"b-shiji-108","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-108-han"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:p007","text":"匈奴來請和親，天子下議。大行王恢，燕人也，數爲邊吏，習知胡事。議曰：「漢與匈奴和親，率不過數歳即復倍約。不如勿許，興兵擊之。」安國曰：「千里而戰，兵不獲利。今匈奴負戎馬之足，懷禽獸之心，遷徙鳥舉，難得而制也。得其地不足以爲廣，有其眾不足以爲彊，自上古不屬爲人。漢數千里爭利，則人馬罷，虜以全制其敝。且彊弩之極，矢不能穿魯縞；沖風之末，力不能漂鴻毛。非初不勁，末力衰也。擊之不便，不如和親。」群臣議者多附安國，於是上許和親。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m007-0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"天子","kind":"person","person_id":"zgv_3zp_3tg","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m007-0014","start":14,"end":16,"surface":"王恢","kind":"person","person_id":"z2v_oh4_mhm","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m007-0063","start":63,"end":65,"surface":"安國","kind":"person","person_id":"adb_4so_0qm","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m007-0123","start":123,"end":124,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"zgv_3zp_3tg","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m007-0201","start":201,"end":203,"surface":"安國","kind":"person","person_id":"adb_4so_0qm","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m007-0206","start":206,"end":207,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"zgv_3zp_3tg","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-108-han","book_id":"b-shiji-108","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-108-han"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:p008","text":"其明年，則元光元年，鴈門馬邑豪聶翁壹因大行王恢言上曰：「匈奴初和親，親信邊，可誘以利。」陰使聶翁壹爲閒，亡入匈奴，謂單于曰：「吾能斬馬邑令丞吏，以城降，財物可盡得。」單于愛信之，以爲然，許聶翁壹。聶翁壹乃還，詐斬死罪囚，縣其頭馬邑城，示單于使者爲信。曰：「馬邑長吏已死，可急來。」於是單于穿塞將十餘萬騎，入武州塞。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m008-0015","start":15,"end":18,"surface":"聶翁壹","kind":"person","person_id":"87t_93a_gy8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m008-0021","start":21,"end":23,"surface":"王恢","kind":"person","person_id":"z2v_oh4_mhm","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m008-0024","start":24,"end":25,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"zgv_3zp_3tg","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m008-0046","start":46,"end":49,"surface":"聶翁壹","kind":"person","person_id":"87t_93a_gy8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m008-0058","start":58,"end":60,"surface":"單于","kind":"person","person_id":"hn9_gz8_uyk","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m008-0083","start":83,"end":85,"surface":"單于","kind":"person","person_id":"hn9_gz8_uyk","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m008-0094","start":94,"end":97,"surface":"聶翁壹","kind":"person","person_id":"87t_93a_gy8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m008-0098","start":98,"end":101,"surface":"聶翁壹","kind":"person","person_id":"87t_93a_gy8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m008-0106","start":106,"end":109,"surface":"死罪囚","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未明示姓名及人數，不由詐稱馬邑長吏補造令丞人物或身份。"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m008-0118","start":118,"end":120,"surface":"單于","kind":"person","person_id":"hn9_gz8_uyk","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m008-0120","start":120,"end":122,"surface":"使者","kind":"person","person_id":"v8p_xn6_zmf","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m008-0142","start":142,"end":144,"surface":"單于","kind":"person","person_id":"hn9_gz8_uyk","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-108-han","book_id":"b-shiji-108","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-108-han"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:p009","text":"當是時，漢伏兵車騎材官二十餘萬，匿馬邑旁谷中。衞尉李廣爲驍騎將軍，太仆公孫賀爲輕車將軍，大行王恢爲將屯將軍，太中大夫李息爲材官將軍。御史大夫韓安國爲護軍將軍，諸將皆屬護軍。約單于入馬邑而漢兵縱發。王恢、李息、李廣別從代主擊其輜重。於是單于入漢長城武州塞。未至馬邑百餘里，行掠鹵，徒見畜牧於野，不見一人。單于怪之，攻烽燧，得武州尉史。欲刺問尉史。尉史曰：「漢兵數十萬伏馬邑下。」單于顧謂左右曰：「幾爲漢所賣！」乃引兵還。出塞，曰：「吾得尉史，乃天也。」命尉史爲「天王」。塞下傳言單于已引去。漢兵追至塞，度弗及，即罷。王恢等兵三萬，聞單于不與漢合，度往擊輜重，必與單于精兵戰，漢兵勢必敗，則以便宜罷兵，皆無功。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m009-0025","start":25,"end":27,"surface":"李廣","kind":"person","person_id":"njk_tl0_6h9","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m009-0035","start":35,"end":38,"surface":"公孫賀","kind":"person","person_id":"kwn_v70_fse","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m009-0046","start":46,"end":48,"surface":"王恢","kind":"person","person_id":"z2v_oh4_mhm","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m009-0058","start":58,"end":60,"surface":"李息","kind":"person","person_id":"tmv_5d7_bx2","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m009-0070","start":70,"end":73,"surface":"韓安國","kind":"person","person_id":"adb_4so_0qm","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m009-0087","start":87,"end":89,"surface":"單于","kind":"person","person_id":"hn9_gz8_uyk","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m009-0098","start":98,"end":100,"surface":"王恢","kind":"person","person_id":"z2v_oh4_mhm","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m009-0101","start":101,"end":103,"surface":"李息","kind":"person","person_id":"tmv_5d7_bx2","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m009-0104","start":104,"end":106,"surface":"李廣","kind":"person","person_id":"njk_tl0_6h9","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m009-0117","start":117,"end":119,"surface":"單于","kind":"person","person_id":"hn9_gz8_uyk","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m009-0151","start":151,"end":153,"surface":"單于","kind":"person","person_id":"hn9_gz8_uyk","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m009-0163","start":163,"end":165,"surface":"尉史","kind":"person","person_id":"2a2_j2z_xyc","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m009-0169","start":169,"end":171,"surface":"尉史","kind":"person","person_id":"2a2_j2z_xyc","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m009-0172","start":172,"end":174,"surface":"尉史","kind":"person","person_id":"2a2_j2z_xyc","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m009-0188","start":188,"end":190,"surface":"單于","kind":"person","person_id":"hn9_gz8_uyk","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m009-0217","start":217,"end":219,"surface":"尉史","kind":"person","person_id":"2a2_j2z_xyc","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m009-0226","start":226,"end":228,"surface":"尉史","kind":"person","person_id":"2a2_j2z_xyc","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m009-0238","start":238,"end":240,"surface":"單于","kind":"person","person_id":"hn9_gz8_uyk","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m009-0257","start":257,"end":259,"surface":"王恢","kind":"person","person_id":"z2v_oh4_mhm","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m009-0265","start":265,"end":267,"surface":"單于","kind":"person","person_id":"hn9_gz8_uyk","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m009-0280","start":280,"end":282,"surface":"單于","kind":"person","person_id":"hn9_gz8_uyk","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-108-han","book_id":"b-shiji-108","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-108-han"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:p010","text":"天子怒王恢不出擊單于輜重，擅引兵罷也。恢曰：「始約虜入馬邑城，兵與單于接，而臣擊其輜重，可得利。今單于聞，不至而還，臣以三萬人眾不敵，禔取辱耳。臣固知還而斬，然得完陛下士三萬人。」於是下恢廷尉。廷尉當恢逗橈，當斬。恢私行千金丞相蚡。蚡不敢言上，而言於太后曰：「王恢首造馬邑事，今不成而誅恢，是爲匈奴報仇也。」上朝太后，太后以丞相言告上。上曰：「首爲馬邑事者，恢也，故發天下兵數十萬，從其言，爲此。且縱單于不可得，恢所部擊其輜重，猶頗可得，以慰士大夫心。今不誅恢，無以謝天下。」於是恢聞之，乃自殺。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m010-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"天子","kind":"person","person_id":"zgv_3zp_3tg","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m010-0003","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"王恢","kind":"person","person_id":"z2v_oh4_mhm","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m010-0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"單于","kind":"person","person_id":"hn9_gz8_uyk","status":"contextual_provisiona